# COMPONENT

## AggregateSample

### PACKAGE

org.sample.aggregate

### DESCRIPTION

Aggregate-oriented sample component.

### SPECIFICATION

This sample demonstrates the application-join aggregate pattern.

### DOMAIN_INTENT

The sample keeps `Entity` as persisted source-of-truth and constructs
an aggregate-shaped read model from multiple entities at runtime.

The first line focuses on:
1. aggregate load
2. aggregate search
3. one delegated aggregate behavior line to be added next

# SERVICE

## Order

### DESCRIPTION

Order-facing operations for aggregate-oriented access.

### OPERATION

#### loadOrderAggregate

##### DESCRIPTION

Loads one order aggregate.

##### TYPE
QUERY

##### IMPLEMENTATION
aggregate-load

##### INPUT

###### TYPE
LoadOrderAggregate

##### OUTPUT

###### TYPE
LoadOrderAggregateResult

#### searchOrderAggregate

##### DESCRIPTION

Searches order aggregates.

##### TYPE
QUERY

##### IMPLEMENTATION
aggregate-search

##### INPUT

###### TYPE
SearchOrderAggregate

##### OUTPUT

###### TYPE
SearchOrderAggregateResult

#### addLine

##### DESCRIPTION

Adds one line to an order aggregate.

##### TYPE
COMMAND

##### INPUT

###### TYPE
AddLine

##### OUTPUT

###### TYPE
AddLineResult
# ENTITY

## Order

### DESCRIPTION

Order root entity.

### ATTRIBUTE

| name   | type     | multiplicity |
|--------+----------+--------------|
| id     | entityid | 1            |
| name   | name     | 1            |
| status | string   | 1            |

### AGGREGATE

#### MEMBER

| name  | entity    | kind        | multiplicity | join_field |
|-------+-----------+-------------+--------------+------------|
| lines | OrderLine | composition | *            | orderId    |

#### COMMAND

##### addLine
- INPUT.orderId :: entityid
- INPUT.lineName :: name
- INPUT.quantity :: int
- VALIDATE :: quantity > 0

#### STATE

| name   | type     | multiplicity |
|--------+----------+--------------|
| id     | entityid | 1            |
| name   | name     | 1            |
| status | string   | 1            |

#### INVARIANT

##### quantityPositive
- EXPRESSION :: quantity > 0

## OrderLine

### DESCRIPTION

Order line entity used as an aggregate member.

### ATTRIBUTE

| name    | type     | multiplicity |
|---------+----------+--------------|
| id      | entityid | 1            |
| orderId | entityid | 1            |
| name    | name     | 1            |
| quantity| int      | 1            |

# QUERY

## LoadOrderAggregate

### DESCRIPTION

Query to load an order aggregate.

### ATTRIBUTE

| name | type     | multiplicity |
|------|----------|--------------|
| id   | entityid | 1            |

## SearchOrderAggregate

### DESCRIPTION

Query to search order aggregates.

### ATTRIBUTE

| name | type | multiplicity |
|------|------|--------------|
| name | name | ?            |

# COMMAND

## AddLine

### DESCRIPTION

Command to add one order line.

### ATTRIBUTE

| name     | type     | multiplicity |
|----------+----------+--------------|
| orderId  | entityid | 1            |
| lineName | name     | 1            |
| quantity | int      | 1            |

# VALUE

## LoadOrderAggregateResult

### ATTRIBUTE

| name   | type      | multiplicity |
|--------+-----------+--------------|
| id     | entityid  | 1            |
| name   | name      | 1            |
| status | string    | 1            |
| lines  | OrderLine | *            |

## SearchOrderAggregateResult

### ATTRIBUTE

| name   | type  | multiplicity |
|--------+-------+--------------|
| orders | Order | *            |

## AddLineResult

### EXTENDS

OperationResult

### ATTRIBUTE

| name     | type     | multiplicity |
|----------+----------+--------------|
| orderId  | entityid | 1            |
| lineName | name     | 1            |
| quantity | int      | 1            |
